Okay, this code is vulnerable because of something called a timing attack.

00:09:27.840 --> 00:09:31.520
Basically, what happens is that in JavaScript, when comparing two strings,

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:35.840
this triple equals function is going to just iterate through each character and compare them.

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:38.800
